    "sections": {
        "description": "Pro Portfolio is a Full Site Editing (FSE) theme crafted especially for portfolios, creatives, and professionals who want to showcase their work with style and clarity. Whether you are a designer, developer, photographer, or freelancer, this theme provides the perfect foundation to present your projects, skills, and achievements in a visually compelling way.Featuring a clean and contemporary design, Pro Portfolio offers extensive customization options and thoughtfully built sections that let you create a unique personal brand without effort. Its fully responsive layout ensures your portfolio looks stunning and functions smoothly across all devices and screen sizes."
